{"a":[32,32],"h":"<p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"132\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 131.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 53.3 61.6 61.6 68.3 75.0 90.7 97.6 106.6 106.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 44.3 75.0 97.6 115.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - Zâhiri bu şimdi söyleniyor: işte bu ki siz va'd olunuyorsunuz. Lâkin müfessirlerin çoğu «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"32\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 31.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 21.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » takdiri ile Âhırette söyleneceği hikâye diyorlar ki: işte bu o ki siz va'd olunuyordunuz diye, ma'nâsında olmuş oluyor. Bunun karînesi aşağıda «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"131\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 131.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 19.4 26.2 26.2 33.0 33.0 48.7 48.7 65.2 65.2 72.0 78.7 78.7 94.4 101.2 101.2 108.0 120.0\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"72.0 94.4 108.0 120.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » dir<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 110.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 33.0 39.7 39.7 48.0 63.7 63.7 63.7 74.3 74.3 86.3 86.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 48.0 93.7\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 59.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.4 20.2 20.2 27.0 27.0 33.7 33.7 42.7 42.7 49.4 49.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 27.0\" y=\"25.6 20.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » den bedel, aradaki söz mu'teriza olmuş oluyor « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"173\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 172.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 19.6 26.3 26.3 34.6 50.3 50.3 50.3 60.7 60.7 60.7 72.7 72.7 89.3 96.0 96.0 102.7 102.7 109.6 116.3 136.6 143.3 143.3 152.3 152.3 161.3\" y=\"25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"26.3 34.6 116.3 161.3\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ma'nâsiyle «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"58\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 58.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.4 21.7 21.7 30.7 39.7 48.0 48.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 30.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ye rabtı da muvafık olur.</p><p>EVVAB, sûrei «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 25.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » da geçtiği üzere Allaha rücuu çok olan ve çok tevbekâr olan ma'nâlarına gelir. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"72\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 71.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 30.0 36.7 36.7 43.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"43.6 55.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - Vazifesini bilib korunan «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"175\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 175.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 9.8 9.8 9.8 16.6 24.0 39.8 39.8 47.3 55.6 55.6 64.6 64.6 77.3 77.3 93.8 104.3 112.6 112.6 123.0 123.0 129.8 136.6 149.3 149.3 156.8 163.6\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"93.8 136.6 163.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » olan ki bu da şöyle bir bedel ile beyan olunuyor: </p>"}